        "Pronađi ključni potez!" to mapOf("de" to "Finde den Schlüsselzug!", "en" to "Find the key move!", "fr" to "Trouvez le coup clé !", "hi" to "मुख्य चाल खोजें!", "it" to "Trova la mossa chiave!", "ru" to "Найдите ключевой ход!", "sr" to "Pronađi ključni potez!", "zh-Hans" to "找出关键的一步！"),
